<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coccĭnĕus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		coccum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>scarlet-colored</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 32, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tomentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 38, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacernae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 131</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.</i>— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Access. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coccĭnus</span></b> , a, um: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 31, 105, § 177</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gausapa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 28, 4</span></i>
			. laena, <i><span class="en">Juv. 3, 283</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aluta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					2, 29, 8</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> In
				<i>plur subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coccĭna</span></b> , ōrum,
				n., <i>scarlet garments</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 2, 39, 1, 2, 43, 8, 14, 131,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> In
				<i>sing. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coccĭnum</span></b> , i, n., =
			coccum, <i><span class="en">Hier. in Isa. 1, 1,
		18</span></i>.</div>
